---
// src/components/SNSSection.astro
// YouTube / SNS 連携セクション
---

<section class="py-20 bg-navy relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- 背景装飾 -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dot-pattern opacity-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-light-blue/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <!-- セクションタイトル -->
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="text-light-blue font-bold text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3">FOLLOW & SUBSCRIBE</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Vlog & SNSをチェック</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm md:text-base max-w-md mx-auto">
        旅のVlogや日常の記録をYouTube・Instagram・Xで発信中。チャンネル登録&フォローお待ちしています！
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- SNSカードグリッド -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">

      <!-- YouTube -->
      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/@kureta-kureta"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-7 text-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-red-400/40"
        id="sns-youtube"
      >
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.5 12 3.5 12 3.5s-7.5 0-9.4.6A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2C0 8.1 0 12 0 12s0 3.9.6 5.8a3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1c1.9.6 9.4.6 9.4.6s7.5 0 9.4-.6a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1C24 15.9 24 12 24 12s0-3.9-.5-5.8zM9.6 15.6V8.4l6.3 3.6-6.3 3.6z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2">YouTube</h3>
        <p class="text-white/50 text-xs mb-4">くれた夫婦のAI旅と暮らし</p>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          旅Vlog・日常・お金の話をYouTubeで動画配信。ブログと連動したコンテンツ。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 text-white text-xs font-bold">
          チャンネル登録 ▶
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Instagram -->
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/kureta_life"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-7 text-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-pink-400/40"
        id="sns-instagram"
      >
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-yellow-400 via-pink-500 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.2c3.2 0 3.6 0 4.9.1 3.3.2 4.8 1.7 5 5 .1 1.3.1 1.6.1 4.8 0 3.2 0 3.6-.1 4.8-.2 3.3-1.7 4.8-5 5-1.3.1-1.6.1-4.9.1-3.2 0-3.6 0-4.8-.1-3.3-.2-4.8-1.7-5-5C2.1 15.6 2 15.3 2 12c0-3.2 0-3.6.1-4.8.2-3.3 1.7-4.8 5-5 1.2-.1 1.6-.1 4.9-.1zM12 0C8.7 0 8.3 0 7.1.1 2.7.3.3 2.7.1 7.1 0 8.3 0 8.7 0 12c0 3.3 0 3.7.1 4.9.2 4.4 2.6 6.8 7 7C8.3 24 8.7 24 12 24c3.3 0 3.7 0 4.9-.1 4.4-.2 6.8-2.6 7-7 .1-1.2.1-1.6.1-4.9 0-3.3 0-3.7-.1-4.9-.2-4.4-2.6-6.8-7-7C15.7 0 15.3 0 12 0zm0 5.8a6.2 6.2 0 1 0 0 12.4A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 12 5.8zM12 16a4 4 0 1 1 0-8 4 4 0 0 1 0 8zm6.4-11.8a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 0 2.8 1.4 1.4 0 0 0 0-2.8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2">Instagram</h3>
        <p class="text-white/50 text-xs mb-4">@kureta_life</p>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          旅のベストショット・日常の写真・ストーリーズで素の私たちをお届け。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-yellow-400 to-pink-500 text-white text-xs font-bold">
          フォローする 📸
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- X (Twitter) -->
      <a
        href="https://x.com/kureta_kureta_x"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-7 text-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-white/30"
        id="sns-x"
      >
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 fill-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.746l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.253 5.622zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2">X (Twitter)</h3>
        <p class="text-white/50 text-xs mb-4">@kureta_kureta_x</p>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          旅先のリアルタイム報告・節約テク・新着記事のお知らせはXで先行発信。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-black border border-white/20 text-white text-xs font-bold">
          フォローする 𝕏
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- YouTube埋め込みプレビュー（最新動画） -->
    <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8">
      <p class="text-white/60 text-xs text-center mb-4 tracking-wider">📹 最新のVlog</p>
      <div class="youtube-embed rounded-2xl">
        <!-- 実際の動画IDに変更してください -->
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
          title="くれた夫婦のAI旅と暮らし - YouTube"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
